5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure we can actually build this without delays. I'll check the firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we look at how people actually use the space. I'll examine the weekday crossing counts and the drainage and heat readings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder who will take care of the park every day. I'll look into the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Drawings can be deceiving. I want to see the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am worried about the long-term financial burden. I will investigate the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the regional habitat fund terms.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
